{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "17353e7e-d831-8d35-a199-e2ca10d7ff05",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T14:35:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jose Quintero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:30:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:30:13-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. Sure, thanks for picking up. My name is Jose Quintero, and I'm calling about water coming off the hill into my yard. Every time it rains or the snow melts, it's the same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:30:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Quintero, I'm sorry to hear that. What's the address where it's happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:30:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, it's 2 Washington Street, down the Point. Right at the corner there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:30:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two Washington Street, in the Point. Got it. And tell me what you're seeing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:30:50-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the water comes down the hill from the next street over, and it runs straight down into my yard. Straight in. It doesn't go in the drain, it just goes right past it. And that storm we had, the snow turning to rain, that ended Monday, three days ago. It's still a mess out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:31:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The snow-to-rain storm, yes. So it came down off the upper street and into your yard. Is the drain on your corner, or up the hill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:31:26-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, sure. There's one on the corner by me, and I think one up the hill too. But the one by me, it's packed with, I don't know, sand and gunk. And the sidewalk out front is a sheet of mud and grit. You can't walk on it without sliding. My customers are tracking it into the place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:31:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. So the sidewalk's covered in mud and grit, and you have customers coming through. Is this a business at that address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:32:03-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, absolutely. I own the shop there. And I've had to sweep it myself three times since Monday. Three times. It just comes right back with the next bit of melt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:32:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Let me write that down. You've swept three times since Monday, and the drain by the corner looks clogged with sand and debris."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:32:28-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, exactly. Sure. And I'd like to know when they last came by. When was the last time anybody from the city cleaned that drain or swept that street? Because I haven't seen a truck in forever."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:32:44-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a fair question. I can't see a cleaning date from my screen right now. Let me look at the work log for that area and see what's there. Can you hold a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:32:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, sure, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:33:03-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for holding. I'm showing the street sanding after the storm, but I don't see a record of that drain being cleaned recently. I don't have a date I can give you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:33:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So nothing. Nothing recent. Okay. Sure, I understand, but that's what I figured. It's not like I haven't said something before about this hill. It just keeps happening and nobody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:33:31-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'm going to put in a request for a crew to check and clear that drain and look at the sand along the curb. Can I repeat back what I have?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:33:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:33:48-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two Washington Street, The Point. Runoff coming down the hill from the next street into your yard, the corner drain clogged with sand and grit, and the sidewalk covered in mud. After the storm that ended Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:34:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it, that's exactly it. Sure. And can you put that it's a business, so there's people walking in and out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:34:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that it's a business with foot traffic. Is there a best number to reach you if the crew has questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:34:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. It's 401-555-0180. That's my cell, so if it cuts out just call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:34:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight oh. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:34:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, perfect, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:34:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I can't promise you a day, but crews are stretched thin after a storm like that, and I'll mark it so it gets looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:34:52-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure, I get that. I do. It's just, honestly, I'm tired of it. And at home it's not much better. My teenager has finals coming up and is stress eating everything in the kitchen, so I'm already running to the store, and then I come back to a muddy sidewalk. Sorry, I'm venting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:35:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all right. It sounds like a lot at once. I'll make sure the request goes in today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:35:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, absolutely. And if nobody shows, can I call back and ask about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:35:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, call back anytime and give them the address, two Washington Street. They'll be able to find the request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:35:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. I'll do that. Thanks for your time, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:35:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Quintero. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T14:35:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye."
    }
  ],
